Attribution: cite as specified in this package's CITATION.cff.

Scope and provenance note: this dataset is generated entirely by this
project's own agent-task and controlled-runtime evaluation code (templated,
deterministically-generated synthetic evaluation inputs; see DATASET_CARD.md
§"Datasets and data generation"). It contains no copied third-party dataset
text or content. It does contain derived numeric outputs (predicted labels,
confidence scores, correctness flags) produced by running two third-party,
Apache-2.0-licensed Hugging Face model checkpoints
(`distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english`,
`distilbert-base-cased-distilled-squad`) locally for inference — see
`LICENSE_PROVENANCE_AUDIT.md` in the Phase 5.6 release directory for the full
upstream-source redistribution audit. This CC BY 4.0 grant applies to this
project's own dataset content (the records, schema, splits, and
documentation); it does not and cannot grant any rights over the two
upstream model checkpoints themselves, which remain governed by their own
Apache-2.0 licenses.
